Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs11\pos(191.2,161.067)\fnGeorgia}Maomao's Diaries
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\c&H55B0E6&\3c&H204060&\blur3\t(0,300,\fscx120\fscy120)\t(0,300,\fscx100\fscy100)\pos(187.733,243.2)}Alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6F9B3F&\pos(219.6,32)\t(0,300,\fscx120\fscy120)\t(300,600,\fscx100\fscy100)}Time for Maomao's Trivia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H142041&\pos(220.533,66.133)\2c&HE8F3F5&\3c&HF5F5F5&\4c&HE5F3F8&}Alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Alchemy. It got its name because it involves making tanyaku, miraculous elixirs that can turn someone into an immortal sage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that taking tanyaku not only grants immortality, but also supernatural abilities like flying through the sky or transforming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Immortality is the ultimate desire of those who have attained wealth, power, and status.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Maomao, about the grasshoppers the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it? No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She seems to be deep in thought.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be an even better strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah! \NI see!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she thinking of measures to prepare for a public hazard?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.01,0:00:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll watch over her without getting in the way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Making people believe in immortality to run a show hut!\NWhat a brilliant businesswoman!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to make a big profit too!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, she's full of motivation!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Material to draw in customers is crucial.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.48,0:01:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did she think of a brilliant idea?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chou?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, the hook is too weak.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sou ka!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did inspiration strike?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Demanding the disclosure of the Three Princesses? No good, I'll get chewed out by the Madam.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shishi-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind me, please keep thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, it's here! \NShishi-sama's meal-tasting experience.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have you finally thought of a foolproof strategy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.24,0:01:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This will sell like hotcakes! \NBut... my head will also fly off...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No good.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.60,0:01:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm counting on you for a good strategy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:02:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(190.933,248.178)}\N{\fnGeorgia\pos(189.6,244.8)}{\fs25\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&H232323&\c&H000000&\2c&HFFFFFF&}Next time: \NThe White Snake Celestial
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally facing the fresh fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay tuned!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\2c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H767679&\4c&HC6C6D0&\pos(192,173.6)}To be continued
